Evening fell in the mountains.
I picked up my bag.
I went back to Lonavala station.
The Mumbai train arrived at seven in the evening.
I boarded the train and sat in my seat.
It was very dark outside.
Nearby, a man took out his phone.
His voice was very loud.
I just kept my eyes closed and rested.
We reached Mumbai late at night.
It was very hot in the city again.
I took a taxi outside the station.
The taxi driver turned on his meter.
I reached my home at eleven at night.
My apartment was completely quiet.
I took off my shoes.
My legs were very tired from walking all day.
But my mind was completely fresh.
This trip to the mountains was very good.
